## 6.9 High Availability and Disaster Recovery (Data)

Merealisasikan NFR-004/005 (HA) dan NFR-028/029/030 (DR) untuk lapis data:

| Kapabilitas          | Realisasi (self-managed, ADR-004)                                          | Target NFR       |
| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------- |
| High Availability    | PostgreSQL *primary–standby* streaming replication via *operator* (mis. CloudNativePG/Patroni); *automatic failover* < 60 detik. | NFR-004, NFR-005 |
| Read scaling         | *Read replica* untuk beban baca/pelaporan.                                 | NFR-003, NFR-010 |
| Backup & PITR        | *WAL archiving* + *Point-in-Time Recovery*; base backup harian, incremental 4 jam. | NFR-029          |
| Disaster Recovery    | Replikasi ke *DR site* geo-redundant; Kafka **MirrorMaker** antar-region.  | NFR-028, NFR-030 |
| RTO / RPO            | RTO ≤ 4 jam; RPO ≤ 15 menit (kehilangan data maksimum 15 menit).           | NFR-028          |

Topologi infrastruktur DR dijabarkan pada **BAB 8.8**.

